# Provenance of the ARB catalogs in this directory
#
# Derived from the canonical Featurely string catalog:
#   repo:   featurely-app
#   path:   packages/locales/catalog/*.arb
#   commit: 705302d352ac9918647b5e568084b0bf8eebf6ba
#   synced: 2026-08-08
#
# Transform (manual, per the SDK spec — no sync tooling in v1):
#   - only `sdk.*` keys are copied (email.* keys are server-side);
#   - key names are camelCased mechanically: strip the dots, capitalize each
#     segment boundary (sdk.form.emailHelper -> sdkFormEmailHelper);
#   - @-metadata and ICU placeholders are preserved on the en template;
#   - inside plural messages, ICU `#` is normalized to the named placeholder
#     (`one {# vote}` -> `one {{count} vote}`) because Flutter gen-l10n does
#     not substitute `#`; this is ICU-equivalent and lossless;
#   - locale ids use `_` separators for Flutter (pt-BR -> pt_BR).
#
# SDK-local extension keys (NOT in the canonical catalog yet — pending
# upstreaming; translations were authored here in the style of the upstream
# catalogs and should be replaced by canonical ones once the keys land):
#   sdkFormAttachError         (spec: "couldn't attach" screenshot rejection)
#   sdkFormEmailError          (spec: invalid_email surfaced as a field error)
#   sdkDetailCommentsDisabled  (spec: 403 comments_disabled stale-config notice)
#   sdkCommonRateLimited       (spec: 429 "try again in a moment" state)
#   sdkFilterShowResultsOverflow  (filter apply label when the count preview
#                                  page was full and more results exist)
#
# To re-sync after a canonical catalog change: repeat the transform above for
# all 25 locales, re-add the extension keys (until upstreamed), update the
# commit hash and date here, then run `flutter gen-l10n`.
